  "title": "Character Tracking in Video-LLMs: A Diagnostic Protocol Analysis",
  "summary": "arXiv AI and arXiv Computer Vision report on video-LLMs' ability to track characters in long-form videos, revealing a 37-38% accuracy on InfiniBench's global appearance task, with a 13-28 point gender gap and 18-25 point drop when open-ended, despite no improvement in video quality.",
